<section
  class="canva-section chapter paper"
  data-template-id="beginning-section"
  id="beginning"
  style="background: rgb(23, 33, 51);"
>
  <div class="chapter-inner grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
    <div>
      <p
        class="canva-text eyebrow mb-5"
        data-template-id="beginning-kicker"
        style="color: rgb(229, 183, 183); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 13px;"
      >
        Chapter one &middot; Where it began
      </p>

      <h2
        class="canva-text chapter-title"
        data-template-id="beginning-title"
        style="color: rgb(248, 241, 230); font-weight: 500; font-style: normal; font-size: 26px;"
      >
        A Sudden Beginning
      </h2>

      <div class="fine-rule my-8"></div>

      <p
        class="canva-text body-copy max-w-lg"
        data-template-id="beginning-copy"
        style="color: rgb(223, 214, 204); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 18px;"
      >
        Some connections find a way to feel quietly extraordinary. This chapter
        is for the beginning of ours, and for every little moment that became
        something worth keeping.
      </p>

      <div
        class="canva-card quiet-card mt-9 p-6 max-w-lg"
        data-template-id="beginning-note-card"
        style="background: rgb(37, 46, 61);"
      >
        <p
          class="canva-text scribble leading-relaxed"
          data-template-id="beginning-note"
          style="color: rgb(232, 197, 195); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 20px;"
        >
           Still remember this day. Although we dont have a picture or WhatsApp message history, but I do remember the day (or the important parts only). It was a Monday morning class Physics class, I dont remember the lesson or the chapter (as i didnt pay much attention in class), but i remember Adrika announcing that it was your birthday that day and i think i texted u first on zoom chat and then on WhatsApp. After that day we started talking and then it was regular Zoom chats during TPB sir's classes and banter on WhatsApp and the rest is history.

        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <figure class="lg:rotate-2">
      <div class="photo-frame rounded-xl h-[390px] sm:h-[520px]">
        <img
          alt="Softly lit landscape placeholder, ready to replace with a personal photograph"
          class="canva-image"
          data-template-id="beginning-photo"
          loading="lazy"
          src="/images/first_message_ava.png"
        />
        <!-- <span
          class="canva-tag photo-tag"
          data-template-id="beginning-photo-label"
          style="background: rgb(34, 43, 57); color: rgb(248, 241, 230); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 13px;"
        >
          Replace with your photo
        </span> -->
      </div>

      <figcaption
        class="canva-text mt-5 text-center"
        data-template-id="beginning-caption"
        style="color: rgb(196, 185, 182); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 15px;"
      >
        A space for a memory that belongs to you.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="flex justify-center mt-12">
      <a
        aria-label="Continue to the first meetup"
        class="canva-link section-next"
        data-template-id="beginning-next"
        href="#first-meetup"
        style="color: rgb(255, 244, 223); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 15px;"
      >
        Next chapter &darr;
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>